e line addition `node_modules/` — correct, nothing problematic.\n- `package-lock.json`: lockfileVersion 3; all 7 resolved URLs point exclusively to `registry.npmjs.org` (no third-party mirrors, no tarballs from suspicious hosts); turbo locked to `2.10.11` (consistent 2.x pin) with sha512 integrity hashes on every entry; no secrets, credentials, or tokens present. Consistent with the `^2.5.0` range in package.json.\n\nNo CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, or LOW issues found.\n\n## Review Summary\n| Severity | Count | Status |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| CRITICAL | 0     | pass   |\n| HIGH     | 0     | pass   |\n| MEDIUM   | 0     | pass   |\n| LOW      | 0     | pass   |\n\nVerdict: APPROVE"}],"model":"unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":21628,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90b6fb7674acfd31","session_id":"9a0ff69f-2dbf-4305-9475-b5fedf9f36bf","uuid":"711c69e5-9a35-4b89-a458-3e395041e628","timestamp":"2026-08-20T09:10:55.635Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"code-reviewer: verify STORY-setup-001a scaffold"}
